  // DISARMED. The changeover has run; the platform is live.
  //
  // Re-arming (Reset: true plus the exact phrase from GoLiveReset.RequiredConfirmPhrase) would
  // empty the database of a LIVE platform. A marker row stops it repeating on this database, but
  // that marker does not exist inside the pre-go-live snapshot — so an armed config plus a restored
  // backup is a second wipe. Leave this off.
  //
  // The address stays because OwnerAccountSeeder reads it: if the owner's account were ever lost,
  // it is recreated and re-invited on the next start. It does nothing while that account exists.
  "GoLive": {
    "Reset": false,
    "ConfirmPhrase": "",
